# Sentinel-X — ACL Mosquitto (contrat : docs/contracts.md)
# Moindre privilège. En TLS mutuel, le nom d'utilisateur d'un client = CN de son certificat.
# Ajouter un bloc par boîtier supplémentaire (esp-02, ...) et par caméra (cam-02, ...).

# --- Boîtier 1 (ESP32-S3)
user esp-01
topic write sentinel/esp-01/telemetry
topic write sentinel/esp-01/event
topic write sentinel/esp-01/health
topic write sentinel/esp-01/status
topic read  sentinel/esp-01/cmd
topic read  sentinel/esp-01/config

# --- Caméra 1 : service vision (tourne sur le PC, hors Docker sous Windows)
user vision
topic write sentinel/cam-01/vision
topic write sentinel/cam-01/status
topic read  sentinel/site/config

# --- API : lit tout ce qui vient des boîtiers, de la vision et de Brain ; pilote commandes et configuration
user api
topic read  sentinel/+/telemetry
topic read  sentinel/+/event
topic read  sentinel/+/health
topic read  sentinel/+/status
topic read  sentinel/+/vision
topic read  sentinel/brain/#
topic write sentinel/+/cmd
topic write sentinel/+/config
topic write sentinel/site/config

# --- Sentinel Brain : lit boîtiers, vision et profil de site ; publie scores et alertes
user anomaly
topic read  sentinel/+/telemetry
topic read  sentinel/+/event
topic read  sentinel/+/health
topic read  sentinel/+/status
topic read  sentinel/+/vision
topic read  sentinel/site/config
topic write sentinel/brain/#

# --- Supervision et tests (mosquitto_sub) : lecture seule
user monitor
topic read  sentinel/#
